@base = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_AQUI

### Registrar viaje
POST {{base}}/viajes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehiculo_id": 1, "conductor_id": 1,
  "fecha_salida": "2026-11-01T08:00:00", "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-01T18:30:00",
  "origen": "La Rioja", "destino": "Córdoba", "kilometros": 620,
  "observaciones": "Sin novedades"
}

### Historial completo
GET {{base}}/viajes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historial por vehículo
GET {{base}}/viajes?vehiculo_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historial por conductor
GET {{base}}/viajes?conductor_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Total de km por vehículo
GET {{base}}/viajes/total-km?vehiculo_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Total de km por conductor
GET {{base}}/viajes/total-km?conductor_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Eliminar viaje
DELETE {{base}}/viajes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
